    "lawCode": "Amd §874, Gen Muni L; amd §§1963 & 2326, Pub Auth L; amd §§252 & 253, Tax L",
    "lawSection": "General Municipal Law",
    "memo": " BILL NUMBER:  S6604\n\n TITLE OF BILL :\n\nAn act to amend the general municipal law, the public authorities law\nand the tax law, in relation to certain recording taxes\n\n PURPOSE OF THE BILL :\n\nThis bill makes technical corrections to a chapter of the laws of\n2016.\n\n JUSTIFICATION :\n\nThis bill makes technical corrections to a chapter of the laws of 2016\nto clarify that projects should not be subject to the additional tax\nimposed by this chapter on a mortgage of real property, if the purpose\nof recording the mortgage is for such mortgage to act as the priority\nof a real property tax lien. This legislation will clarify that the\nchapter being amended did not result in double taxation.\n\n LEGISLATIVE HISTORY :\n\nNew bill.\n\n FISCAL IMPLICATIONS :\n\nNone.\n\n EFFECTIVE DATE :\nThis act shall take effect on the same date and in the same manner as\nchapter 394 of the laws of 2016 takes effect.\n",
